		(comp
			(ref "L501")
			(value "L_CELL 224uH (CUSTOM)")
			(description "CHASSIS-MOUNTED CUSTOM power inductor rev M2 (sim/out/magnetics/design_pv_inductor.json, winding sheet sim/out/magnetics/spec_pv_inductor.md): 2 x POCO NPC290026 (NPC 26, 74/45/35 mm) stacked toroid (as M1), 37 turns of solid round enamelled Cu 3.15 mm grade 2, 1 layer, core wrapped 2 x 0.13 mm Nomex 410 + polyimide, VPI class H, NTC at the bore-side winding centre in a reinforced pocket; insulating base with a centre clamp in the cell air stream. L0 244 uH, 226 uH nom / 208 uH min at 45 A, ripple 34.6 App at 32 kHz, 1.74 kg, proposed construction - calculated, not built or measured (design to cost, D-044). Leads A (through the phase's STK-HO/A 75 on the board) and B on press-fit studs; embedded winding NTC to a 2-pin header (NTC line on PC); core and clamp bonded to PE (basic winding-core, B2): winding-core basic: core wrapped 2 x 0.13 mm Nomex 410 + 1 x 0.05 mm polyimide over the epoxy coating (coating not counted), grade-2 enamel (not counted as insulation), VPI class H varnish (no air at the core edges); NTC in a reinforced pocket (3 layers polyimide + silicone sleeve) at the inner-side winding centre")
